Claude credential parsing and no-data metadata query design references:
https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar/tree/5f93dc3068b3bee3f8753f3772614cc2949c335d
Sources/CodexBarCore/Providers/Claude/ClaudeOAuth/ClaudeOAuthCredentials.swift
Sources/CodexBarCore/Providers/Claude/ClaudeOAuth/ClaudeOAuthCredentialModels.swift
Sources/CodexBarCore/Providers/Claude/ClaudeConfigPaths.swift

Only explicit user Refresh reads provider-owned credentials here. No token
refresh, credential persistence, ACL preauthorization, or background secret read is
implemented. Native Claude profile service selection was independently checked
against the installed Claude Code 2.1.311 bundle.

